WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.400
01 / Request privately. The input stays masked.

00:00:03.400 --> 00:00:04.400
Only the name and availability are returned.

00:00:04.400 --> 00:00:08.500
02 / Use the environment variable. Exact output is redacted.

00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:10.200
03 / Inspect locally. The secret starts masked.

00:00:10.200 --> 00:00:12.000
C → Y confirms copy. Clipboard is simulated in this demo.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:14.300
Copy succeeds without revealing. Native clipboard untouched.

00:00:14.300 --> 00:00:16.200
R → Y confirms reveal. Recordings can retain the value.

00:00:16.200 --> 00:00:18.700
Fake value revealed locally, then hidden again.

00:00:18.700 --> 00:00:23.100
04 / Clear the vault. The secret is no longer available.

00:00:23.100 --> 00:00:26.000
Transcript hygiene, not a security boundary.
